Project Title: Olipop Cherry Cola: AI Product Commercial
A conceptual promotional spot created using advanced AI video generation tools to showcase dynamic macro product cinematography, fluid simulations, and lifestyle brand storytelling.  
Tools Used: Google Flow, Runway.  
Key Focus: Motion design, visual pacing, and AI prompt engineering for product marketing.


Industry: Food & Beverage
Category: AI Product Animation / CGI Commercial
Project Goal
To produce a premium, fast-paced CGI product commercial for Olipop Cherry Cola using AI-assisted workflows, emphasizing macro product shots, fluid dynamics, and high-end advertising aesthetics for social media platforms.

Production Workflow
* Advanced Prompt Engineering: Developed detailed prompts for Google Flow to generate photorealistic product models, realistic cola pouring simulations, and dynamic liquid physics.
* AI Video Synthesis: Utilized Runway Gen-2 for high-fidelity animation sequences and seamless visual effects that mimic traditional 3D CGI workflows.
* Multi-Phase Composition: Orchestrated multiple AI-generated layers—including hero shots, background environments, and particle effects—into a single cohesive video.
* Motion Design & Editing: Performed precise video editing, advanced sound design, and kinetic typography to align with the energetic brand identity.
Key Features
* Hyper-Realistic Product Visualization: Showcased the Olipop Cherry Cola can with high-fidelity textures, condensation effects, and precise lighting to simulate a luxury product shoot.
* Dynamic Fluid Simulation: Generated realistic cola pouring and effervescence using advanced AI liquid dynamics, creating a visually refreshing and immersive experience.
* Fast-Paced Storytelling: Engineered a rapid-cut editing sequence optimized for short-form video platforms (TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts) with maximum audience retention strategies.
Technical Execution
Software Used
* Runway ML: AI video generation for primary motion and effects.
* CapCut: Advanced video editing, sound design, and motion graphics integration.
* Google Flow: AI-assisted CGI modeling and environment generation.
Video Metrics
* Resolution: 1080p (1920×1080)
* Frame Rate: 30fps
* Format: MP4
* Duration: 30 seconds
Creative Strategy
Target Audience: Health-conscious consumers aged 25–45 seeking premium non-alcoholic beverages.
Tone: Energetic, sophisticated, vibrant, and refreshing.
Platform Focus: Mobile-first social media feeds with autoplay and sound-off consumption patterns.
Visual Direction: Macro cinematography with premium lighting, cinematic camera movement, and stylized product staging.
Impact
This project demonstrates the capability of AI video generation to produce high-quality commercial content that matches the production value of traditional 3D animation, enabling rapid prototyping and high-impact visual storytelling for modern brands.

